  "limitations": [
    "Safe branch engages a proximity-gated grasp-assist weld on target_mug only after GR-1's five Fourier fingers close within 6.8 cm of the mug grasp site (and releases it cleanly over the receiving plate); the egg, obstacle bowl, plate, counter, and all other props interact under 100% pure native MuJoCo rigid-body contact.",
